## ML1 — A high-degree bipartite graph: the cost of edge uuids crossing stores when the edge condition is off graph
traits: start=unique key hops=2 fan-out=high aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: u.user_id | R5 edge: r1.rating, r2.rating | R6 aggregate / sort: v.user_id

### ML1 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(v.user_id, common)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[common DESC, v.user_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: v.user_id | count(*) AS common]
  :       GetProperty(v.user_id) [node:User]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[r1, r2]
  :           Filter((r2.rating >= 4.5))
  :             GetProperty(r2.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :               Expand((m)<-[r2:RATED]-(v:User))
  :                 Filter((r1.rating >= 4.5))
  :                   GetProperty(r1.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :                     Expand((u)-[r1:RATED]->(m:Movie))
  :                       Filter((u.user_id = "1"))
  :                         GetProperty(u.user_id) [node:User]
  :                           EntityScan(u:User)

### ML1 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[common DESC, v.user_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: v.user_id | count(*) AS common]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(v) out=(v, v.user_id)
        : GetProperty(v.user_id) [node:User]
        :   Argument(v)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(r2) out=(r2)
          : Filter((r2.rating >= 4.5))
          :   GetProperty(r2.rating) [rel:RATED]
          :     Argument(r2)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(r1) out=(r1)
            : Filter((r1.rating >= 4.5))
            :   GetProperty(r1.rating) [rel:RATED]
            :     Argument(r1)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(u) out=(u, r1, r2, v)
              : RelUniqueFilter[r1, r2]
              :   Expand((m)<-[r2:RATED]-(v:User))
              :     Expand((u)-[r1:RATED]->(m:Movie))
              :       Argument(u)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(u)
                : Filter((u.user_id = "1"))
                :   GetProperty(u.user_id) [node:User]
                :     EntityScan(u:User)

