## ML2 — Two hops with exploding fan-out: where placing the edge and end conditions starts to pay off
traits: start=unique key hops=2 fan-out=explosive aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: m.movie_id | R2 end: o.year | R5 edge: r.rating, r.timestamp, r2.rating | R6 aggregate / sort: o.title

### ML2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.title, c)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[c DESC, o.title ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: o.title | count(*) AS c]
  :       GetProperty(o.title) [node:Movie]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[r, r2]
  :           Filter((o.year >= 2010))
  :             GetProperty(o.year) [node:Movie]
  :               Filter((r2.rating >= 5))
  :                 GetProperty(r2.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :                   Expand((u)-[r2:RATED]->(o:Movie))
  :                     Filter((r.timestamp >= 1500000000))
  :                       GetProperty(r.timestamp) [rel:RATED]
  :                         Filter((r.rating >= 5))
  :                           GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :                             Expand((m)<-[r:RATED]-(u:User))
  :                               Filter((m.movie_id = "1"))
  :                                 GetProperty(m.movie_id) [node:Movie]
  :                                   EntityScan(m:Movie)

### ML2 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, o.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.title | count(*) AS c]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.title)
        : GetProperty(o.title) [node:Movie]
        :   Filter((o.year >= 2010))
        :     GetProperty(o.year) [node:Movie]
        :       Argument(o)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(r2) out=(r2)
          : Filter((r2.rating >= 5))
          :   GetProperty(r2.rating) [rel:RATED]
          :     Argument(r2)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(r) out=(r)
            : Filter((r.timestamp >= 1500000000))
            :   GetProperty(r.timestamp) [rel:RATED]
            :     Filter((r.rating >= 5))
            :       GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
            :         Argument(r)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(m) out=(m, o, r, r2)
              : RelUniqueFilter[r, r2]
              :   Expand((u)-[r2:RATED]->(o:Movie))
              :     Expand((m)<-[r:RATED]-(u:User))
              :       Argument(m)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(m)
                : Filter((m.movie_id = "1"))
                :   GetProperty(m.movie_id) [node:Movie]
                :     EntityScan(m:Movie)

