## ML3 — One hop aggregating an edge property: absorption when the aggregated value is on the edge
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: m.year | R6 aggregate / sort: m.title, r.rating

### ML3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(m.title, ratings, avgRating)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[ratings DESC, m.title ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: m.title | count(r) AS ratings, avg(r.rating) AS avgRating]
  :       GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :         GetProperty(m.title) [node:Movie]
  :           Expand((m)<-[r:RATED]-(u:User))
  :             Filter((m.year = 1995))
  :               GetProperty(m.year) [node:Movie]
  :                 EntityScan(m:Movie)

### ML3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[ratings DESC, m.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: m.title | count(r) AS ratings, avg(r.rating) AS avgRating]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(r) out=(r, r.rating)
        : GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
        :   Argument(r)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(m) out=(m, m.title)
          : GetProperty(m.title) [node:Movie]
          :   Argument(m)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(m) out=(m, r)
            : Expand((m)<-[r:RATED]-(u:User))
            :   Argument(m)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(m)
              : Filter((m.year = 1995))
              :   GetProperty(m.year) [node:Movie]
              :     EntityScan(m:Movie)

### ML3 @document
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[ratings DESC, m.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: m.title | count(r) AS ratings, avg(r.rating) AS avgRating]
      Fetch[mongo] in=(r) out=(r, r.rating)
        : GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
        :   Argument(r)
        Fetch[mongo] in=(m) out=(m, m.title)
          : GetProperty(m.title) [node:Movie]
          :   Argument(m)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(m) out=(m, r)
            : Expand((m)<-[r:RATED]-(u:User))
            :   Argument(m)
            StoreQuery[mongo] out=(m)
              : Filter((m.year = 1995))
              :   GetProperty(m.year) [node:Movie]
              :     EntityScan(m:Movie)

