## ML4 — No vertex condition, only an edge condition: the cost of plans starting from an edge scan
traits: start=narrowed by edges hops=1 fan-out=high aggregate Top-20 | R5 edge: r.timestamp, r.rating | R6 aggregate / sort: m.movie_id

### ML4 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(m.movie_id, c)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[c DESC, m.movie_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: m.movie_id | count(*) AS c]
  :       GetProperty(m.movie_id) [node:Movie]
  :         Filter((r.rating = 0.5))
  :           GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
  :             Filter((r.timestamp >= 1560000000))
  :               GetProperty(r.timestamp) [rel:RATED]
  :                 Expand((u)-[r:RATED]->(m:Movie))
  :                   EntityScan(u:User)

### ML4 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, m.movie_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: m.movie_id | count(*) AS c]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(m) out=(m, m.movie_id)
        : GetProperty(m.movie_id) [node:Movie]
        :   Argument(m)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(r) out=(r)
          : Filter((r.rating = 0.5))
          :   GetProperty(r.rating) [rel:RATED]
          :     Filter((r.timestamp >= 1560000000))
          :       GetProperty(r.timestamp) [rel:RATED]
          :         Argument(r)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(m, r)
            : Expand((u)-[r:RATED]->(m:Movie))
            :   EntityScan(u:User)

